- The contributor's modifications to the CONTACT.md file or LICENSE-ADD file do NOT grant them commercial rights to the original author's work. Any commercial use of the original work or its derivatives still requires the original author's explicit written authorization.

Special Provisions for Video Works:
- When distributing the complete video work as a whole, the license notice must be included at the beginning of the video.
- When using individual elements extracted from the video work (such as clips, audio snippets, visual effects, or other separable components), the licensee is NOT required to include the full license notice, provided that such elements are used in a new, derivative work and are not used to replicate or redistribute the original video work in its entirety.
