- Attribution must be clearly provided in one of the following forms:
  * In a video, attribution must appear as a text overlay within the video itself (such as bottom or corner text) or in a prominent section of the video description, clearly stating the original project name or the original author's name.
  * If attribution cannot be reasonably displayed in the above manner due to platform restrictions (such as short-form video platforms with limited description space), the licensee must include the attribution in the video content itself as a brief text notation.
  * The attribution must be sufficient for a reasonable viewer to identify the original work and its author.

